### 首次注册：设备指纹有效
POST http://localhost:8080/device/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "学习用模拟设备",
  "model": "simulator-v1",
  "os": "Android",
  "osVersion": "15",
  "fingerprint": "sim-install-001"
}

### 首次注册：设备指纹无效
POST http://localhost:8080/device/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "学习用模拟设备",
  "model": "simulator-v1",
  "os": "Android",
  "osVersion": "15",
  "fingerprint": " "
}

### 修改已有设备的名称
PATCH http://localhost:8080/device/dev_5037fd1b-9be3-4d14-87e8-7d3a339237db/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "一个新名字"
}

### 修改不存在设备的名称
PATCH http://localhost:8080/device/dev/name
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceName": "一个新名字"
}